  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia PFM Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to enhance public financial management by strengthening: (a) revenue mobilization and (b) budget execution processes through the implementation of the Financial Management Information System (FMIS). Progress against the principal objective will be measured by the contribution made to the PFMRP&#x2019;s Key Performance Indicators and Targets set forth under the Stage Two of the PFMRP.</narrative>
  </description>
